IndigoPlateau_Interior5_Text_Pidgeot::
	.string "PIDGEOT: Pijooot...!$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior5_Text_OldMan1_1::
	.string "Ah! You’re challenging the ELITE\n"
	.string "FOUR? Are you sure you’re ready?\p"
	.string "If you need to train some more,\n"
	.string "my PIDGEOT can help you.\p"
	.string "It can FLY you home.\p"
	.string "Would you like to go home now?$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior5_Text_OldMan1_2::
	.string "OK, OK. The best of luck to you!$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior5_Text_OldMan1_3::
	.string "OK, OK. Get ready for a speedy\n"
	.string "trip!\p"
	.string "NOW!$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior5_Text_CooltrainerM::
	.string "At the POKéMON LEAGUE, you’ll get\n"
	.string "tested by the ELITE FOUR.\p"
	.string "You have to beat them all. If you\n"
	.string "lose, you have to start all over!$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior5_Text_Trigger1_1::
	.string "Hold it.\p"
	.string "You’re going to take the POKéMON\n"
	.string "LEAGUE challenge now?\p"
	.string "That’s not going to happen.\p"
	.string "My super-well-trained POKéMON\n"
	.string "are going to pound you.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}! I challenge you!$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior5_Text_Trigger1Defeat::
	.string "...\p"
	.string "OK--I lost...$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior5_Text_Trigger1Victory::
	.string "...\n"
	.string "Whew...\p"
	.string "With my partners,\n"
	.string "I’m going to be the Champion!$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior5_Text_Trigger1_2::
	.string "...Darn... I still can’t win...\p"
	.string "I... I have to think more about my\n"
	.string "POKéMON...\p"
	.string "Humph! Try not to lose!$"
